# No per-version updates

Never add What's new sections, changelogs, release summaries or documentation pages organized by version to Ax's website, introductory documentation or README. Remove existing per-version update lists. Maintain documentation of the current product behavior in place.

This user instruction overrides any policy that requires updating a What's new section during releases. Software version identifiers used by installers, download assets and CLI metadata must still be accurate.
